    "final_answer": "I'm encountering approval-required errors when trying to access the file system. This appears to be a system-level restriction rather than something I can resolve directly.\n\nHowever, based on your question about escalation timing from `per_ops/escalation.rst`, this sounds like an operational procedure document that likely contains information about when to escalate incidents or issues.\n\nSince I cannot read the file due to these access restrictions, could you:\n1. Tell me where this file is located (e.g., what directory structure), or\n2. Share the relevant section from the file that mentions escalation timing?\n\nAlternatively, if you have a memory system available, I could help you store this information there so you don't forget next time. Would you like me to create a memory entry for you with the escalation timing once you provide it?"
